     "lesson": "Live Sheerline Prestige runs ~10% above register alu medians, and this benchmark predated the system-depth coupling correction, so the gap on a correctly-built job would be wider than -9.5%. NOTE THE ISSUED FIGURE IS ITSELF SHORT: BSW added GBP 143.01 of restrictors 41 minutes before the send and it never reached the document, so the sell rests on a supply cost we no longer have. When you compare against an issued number, check the supplier quote behind it is still the current one.",
