   "body": "Adam,\n Your three questions, answered. Nothing has been queried with SMD yet - so the RFI is\ndrafted and attached, ready to send to Martin Moore as it stands.\n 1. EXTRA DOORS - correct, and it is 7 of them.\n Type E.01, 5no steel sports hall escape doors 1810x2110 (ED.0.04/06/07/08/09), and\n Type E.03, 2no aluminium louvred plant room doors (ED.0.01/05). On door schedule P06,\n absent from their BoQ. Their own pricing schedule says 48 m2 of external doors; the\n bill measures 24.96 m2; adding these seven gives 51.70 m2, so the schedule is right.\n ~GBP 32,462 of sell at benchmark plus the louvres, which have no rate on file.\n\n 2. TRIPLE GLAZING - not queried either. Windows are triple and compliant; the doors are\n double. Bellview quoted 6.8 Lami / 4mm Tuff on every position. The RFI asks SMD to\n accept a double glazed door at the 1.2 W/m2K door U-value they set at ER 5.4.1, which\n it does meet, and says we will tender on that and state the deviation if they do not\n reply. The proposal currently says &quot;triple glazing throughout&quot; - that line has to come\n out before anything goes.\n\n 3. SOLAR CONTROL - no, not allowed for anywhere. The window schedule marks all 35 windows\n &quot;Triple Glazed, Solar Control Glazing&quot; and ER 7.5.17 requires it; BSW quoted &quot;Clr&quot; on\n every line. About GBP 4,177 at GBP 35/m2 over 119 m2. Neither the schedule nor the ERs\n name a product or a g-value, so the RFI asks for one.\n\n Two days to Friday. The RFI needs to go today to stand any chance of an answer, and it is\nwritten so our tender goes on time whether or not they reply.\n Still outstanding from Monday: nobody has authority to raise the steel sports-hall doorset\nand louvred doorset enquiries. Those seven doors cannot be priced until someone can put\nthem out.\n Mary\n Kind regards,\n Mary Grace \n Estimator\n 01908 429200 \n 97-98 Alston Drive\nBradwell Abbey, MK13 9HF \n www.fensterglazing.com \n\n This email and any attachments to it may be confidential and are intended solely for the use of the individual to whom it is addressed. Any views or opinions expressed are solely those of the author and do not necessarily represent those of Fenster Glazing & Locks Ltd. If you are not the intended recipient of this email, you must neither take any action based upon its contents, nor copy or show it to anyone. Please contact the sender if you believe you have received this email in error."
