   "subject": "Grange Hill - BSW are in. GBP 40,528.59, and do not send the 27,560",
   "body": "Adam,\n BSW came back at 10:48. Two quotes, GBP 22,831.09 buy net.\n THE NUMBER\n Supplier-backed sell: GBP 37,278.59\n Plus the two allowances that are still ours: GBP 3,000 auto door operator, GBP 250 manifestations.\n So GBP 40,528.59 for Luke, before the three things below.\n Do not send the GBP 27,560 benchmark I gave you on the 24th. It was wrong in both directions at once - I priced it as curtain walling at about GBP 1,000/m2 where BSW sell it at GBP 598/m2, and I measured 23.5m2 where they measure 62.3m2. The rate was double and the area was a third, so the total looked sane and was not.\n THREE THINGS THAT ARE NOT IN IT\n 1. BSW REFUSE THE CHAPEL FOLDING DOORS. Not just &quot;no drawing&quot; - their words are they do not supply it with a level or recessed threshold and it cannot support the toplights. Both are things spec 3.15 requires. That needs a specialist, not a chase. Carry it as a provisional sum or exclude it.\n\n 2. THE GLASS IS NOT WHAT THE SPEC ASKS FOR. Spec wants Pilkington Optitherm S1 Arctic Blue. They have quoted SKN 176 HP Neutral in the windows and Anti Sun Grey in the doors - two different tints in the same elevations. Samples are required before order, so this will surface.\n\n 3. TWO SYSTEMS THAT CANNOT BE JOINED. Windows are Sheerline 70mm, doors are SMA Smart Wall 100mm, and the windows sit directly above the doors on both elevations. That is the same mistake we caught on SM5 Wexham. It needs settling with BSW before any order.\n\n Also not included: delivery (their quote says ex works), the Yale thumbturn cylinders the spec names, and 3.16 - still REQ-33.\n Mary\n Kind regards,\n Mary Grace \n Estimator\n 01908 429200 \n 97-98 Alston Drive\nBradwell Abbey, MK13 9HF \n www.fensterglazing.com \n\n This email and any attachments to it may be confidential and are intended solely for the use of the individual to whom it is addressed. Any views or opinions expressed are solely those of the author and do not necessarily represent those of Fenster Glazing & Locks Ltd. If you are not the intended recipient of this email, you must neither take any action based upon its contents, nor copy or show it to anyone. Please contact the sender if you believe you have received this email in error."
